OL,3,GNEWSAThousands watch centuries-old Lord
OL,4,AMayor's show
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 2.86-mile (4.6km) procession, from
OL,7,FMansion House to the Royal Courts of
OL,8,FJustice and back again, happened on
OL,9,FSaturday morning. Organisers had
OL,10,Fexpected more than 350,000 people to
OL,11,Fline the route.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
